# Claude Code rules are generated per-machine by scripts/sync-rules.ps1 and consumed
# via a per-machine junction (~/.claude/rules/dustin-thomason). Pointer rules embed this
# machine's absolute repo path, so committing them would churn across machines. AGENTS.md
# is the committed, machine-neutral output. Regenerate .claude/rules after clone (see README).
/.claude/rules/

# Browser-loop tooling deps (scripts/browser, added in a later phase).
/scripts/browser/node_modules/
